{"provider":"github","id":"7302","externalId":"5831101119","revision":"2026-10-13T15:45:18Z","type":"issue","title":"journalclient: BranchOwnership hardcodes provider \"github\", so ADO run branches are never reconciled","body":"## What is wrong\n`BranchOwnership` only recognises external refs with `Provider == \"github\"`, so run branches on ADO repos (journaled with provider \"ado\") are never matched and never reconciled.\n\nLocation: `internal/journalclient/file.go:BranchOwnership` (~line 553: `event.ExternalRef.Provider == \"github\" \u0026\u0026 event.ExternalRef.Kind == \"branch\" ...`).\n\nEvidence: line confirmed by the latent-bugs lens; producers journal the repo's actual provider. Not executed against a live ADO run.\n\n## Proposed scope\nMatch the branch ExternalRef on Kind regardless of provider (or against the run's configured provider), with a test for an ADO-provider branch event.\n\n## Acceptance\n- ADO branch refs resolve to their owning run\n- GitHub behaviour unchanged; regression test added\n\nConfidence: moderate (lens: latent-bugs)\n\nNomination key: qs/latent-bugs/internal/journalclient/file.go#BranchOwnership\n","labels":["area:providers","goobers:approved","goobers:ready","goobers:claimed","goobers:nominated","type:bug","goobers:cloud"],"state":"open","status":"open","links":[{"rel":"self","url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7302"}],"url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7302","createdAt":"2026-10-13T13:22:07Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-13T15:45:18Z","readyAt":"2026-10-13T13:41:38Z","fields":{"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-10-13T13:22:07Z","id":5831101119,"issue_dependencies_summary.total_blocked_by":0,"locked":false,"number":7302,"state":"open","title":"journalclient: BranchOwnership hardcodes provider \"github\", so ADO run branches are never reconciled","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:45:18Z","user.login":"goobersbot[bot]"},"raw":{"id":5831101119,"number":7302,"title":"journalclient: BranchOwnership hardcodes provider \"github\", so ADO run branches are never reconciled","body":"## What is wrong\n`BranchOwnership` only recognises external refs with `Provider == \"github\"`, so run branches on ADO repos (journaled with provider \"ado\") are never matched and never reconciled.\n\nLocation: `internal/journalclient/file.go:BranchOwnership` (~line 553: `event.ExternalRef.Provider == \"github\" \u0026\u0026 event.ExternalRef.Kind == \"branch\" ...`).\n\nEvidence: line confirmed by the latent-bugs lens; producers journal the repo's actual provider. Not executed against a live ADO run.\n\n## Proposed scope\nMatch the branch ExternalRef on Kind regardless of provider (or against the run's configured provider), with a test for an ADO-provider branch event.\n\n## Acceptance\n- ADO branch refs resolve to their owning run\n- GitHub behaviour unchanged; regression test added\n\nConfidence: moderate (lens: latent-bugs)\n\nNomination key: qs/latent-bugs/internal/journalclient/file.go#BranchOwnership\n","state":"open","state_reason":"","locked":false,"comments":4,"html_url":"https://github.com/Agent-Clubhouse/Goobers/issues/7302","user":{"login":"goobersbot[bot]","type":"Bot"},"labels":[{"name":"area:providers","color":"5319e7","description":"GitHub/ADO issues + PR providers"},{"name":"goobers:approved","color":"0E8A16","description":"Maintainer-approved — eligible for curation/implementation (SEC-047)"},{"name":"goobers:ready","color":"1D76DB","description":"Curated and scoped — eligible for implementation"},{"name":"goobers:claimed","color":"FBCA04","description":"Currently claimed by an in-flight run"},{"name":"goobers:nominated","color":"5319E7","description":"Filed by the nominator — awaiting maintainer approval"},{"name":"type:bug","color":"D73A4A","description":"Defect in existing behavior"},{"name":"goobers:cloud","color":"1d76db","description":"Claim-partition: issue belongs to the cloud (Goobernetes) instance"}],"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"created_at":"2026-10-13T13:22: